{"seq":3,"slug":"arrays-beamforming","title":"天线阵列与波束成形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/antennas/arrays-beamforming","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"天线阵列与波束成形\">天线阵列与波束成形</h1><p>一根单独的<a href=\"antenna-types\">贴片或偶极子天线</a>增益有限、波束固定。但如果把许多这样的单元排成阵列，并精确控制每个单元馈电信号的幅度与相位，整个阵列的辐射就能像被「重塑」一样——波束可以变窄、增益可以叠加，更妙的是，波束指向能在不转动任何机械结构的情况下，由相位电调瞬时扫到任意方向。这就是相控阵与波束成形，它是现代雷达、5G 毫米波、卫星互联网的共同技术基石。本节讲清阵列因子如何决定方向图、波束如何被相位「偏转」、栅瓣与单元间距的关系，以及模拟、数字、混合三种波束成形架构的工程取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>阵列辐射方向图等于单元方向图乘以阵列因子（方向图乘积定理）。阵列因子只取决于单元的几何排布与各单元的激励（幅度、相位），与单元本身是什么天线无关。这种「分离」让设计极为模块化：先用单元决定基础覆盖，再用阵列因子决定波束的窄度与指向。对一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 元等间距线阵，阵列因子的主瓣方向由相邻单元间的相位差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 决定。当相位差满足下式时，波束指向角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mi>λ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta = -k d \\sin\\theta_0, \\quad k = \\frac{2\\pi}{\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是单元间距。改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>（电调相位）就能改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，无需物理转动——这是相控阵的全部魔力所在。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[信号源] --&gt; B[功分网络]&#10;    B --&gt; P1[移相器1] --&gt; E1[单元1]&#10;    B --&gt; P2[移相器2] --&gt; E2[单元2]&#10;    B --&gt; P3[移相器3] --&gt; E3[单元3]&#10;    B --&gt; P4[移相器4] --&gt; E4[单元4]&#10;    E1 --&gt; S[空间合成&lt;br/&gt;波束指向 theta0]&#10;    E2 --&gt; S&#10;    E3 --&gt; S&#10;    E4 --&gt; S&#10;    C[改变相位差 beta] -.电调.-&gt; S\">flowchart TD\n    A[信号源] --&gt; B[功分网络]\n    B --&gt; P1[移相器1] --&gt; E1[单元1]\n    B --&gt; P2[移相器2] --&gt; E2[单元2]\n    B --&gt; P3[移相器3] --&gt; E3[单元3]\n    B --&gt; P4[移相器4] --&gt; E4[单元4]\n    E1 --&gt; S[空间合成&lt;br/&gt;波束指向 theta0]\n    E2 --&gt; S\n    E3 --&gt; S\n    E4 --&gt; S\n    C[改变相位差 beta] -.电调.-&gt; S</pre><h2 id=\"阵列因子-波束变窄与增益叠加\">阵列因子、波束变窄与增益叠加</h2><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个单元排成一列、等幅同相馈电，它们的辐射在垂直方向相干叠加，主瓣变窄、增益提升。理论上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 元阵列相比单元增益增加约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\log_{10}N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> dB（如 16 元约 +12 dB），同时半功率波束宽度近似反比于阵列的电长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Nd/\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>。这就是为什么相控阵能在毫米波下用许多小贴片「拼」出窄波束高增益——单个毫米波贴片增益低，但 256 元阵列轻松达到 20 dBi 以上，恰好补偿<a href=\"../systems/link-budget-noise\">链路预算</a>里毫米波巨大的路径损耗。代价是阵列在主瓣之外有副瓣，副瓣会接收/辐射不该有的方向，造成干扰与功率浪费。通过给各单元施加幅度加权（锥削，如泰勒/切比雪夫分布），可压低副瓣，但代价是主瓣略微变宽、增益略降——这又是一处经典的射频折中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"栅瓣与单元间距的硬约束\">栅瓣与单元间距的硬约束</h2><p>相控阵设计有一条不可逾越的红线：单元间距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 太大会产生栅瓣——除主瓣外另一个同样强的「假主瓣」指向错误方向，把能量泄漏出去甚至造成测向歧义。为在扫描范围内避免栅瓣，间距须满足约束，扫描角越大要求间距越小：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\le \\frac{\\lambda}{1 + |\\sin\\theta_{\\max}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若要扫到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm60°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">60°</span></span></span></span></span>，间距需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.54</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\le0.54\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.54</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，工程上常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=\\lambda/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 作安全值。这条约束直接决定了阵列单元数：固定口径下间距越小、单元越多、移相器与收发通道越多、成本越高。下表对比不同间距的后果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单元间距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>栅瓣情况</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全扫描无栅瓣</td>\n<td>通用相控阵安全值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大角度扫描出栅瓣</td>\n<td>小角度扫描可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>法向也可能有栅瓣</td>\n<td>仅固定波束/稀疏阵需特殊设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三种波束成形架构\">三种波束成形架构</h2><p>如何对每个单元施加幅相控制，决定了系统的成本、灵活性与功耗，主流有三种架构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>控制位置</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模拟波束成形</td>\n<td>射频段移相器</td>\n<td>成本低、功耗小、通道少</td>\n<td>一次只能一个波束</td>\n<td>毫米波终端、低成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字波束成形</td>\n<td>基带（每单元一路收发+ADC）</td>\n<td>多波束、灵活、可同时多用户</td>\n<td>成本高、功耗大、ADC 多</td>\n<td>sub-6 GHz 大规模 MIMO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合波束成形</td>\n<td>射频子阵 + 基带</td>\n<td>折中成本与灵活</td>\n<td>设计复杂</td>\n<td>5G 毫米波基站主流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数字波束成形是大规模 MIMO（Massive MIMO）的基础：基站用几十上百根天线为多个用户同时形成独立波束（空分复用），大幅提升频谱效率，这是 5G sub-6 GHz 容量提升的主要来源。但在毫米波，给每根天线配一路完整收发+高速 ADC 太贵太耗电，于是 2026 年的 5G 毫米波基站普遍采用混合架构：把单元分成若干子阵，子阵内用模拟移相器，子阵间用数字处理，兼顾多波束能力与可承受的成本。每路通道还需配套<a href=\"../rf-circuits/lna-pa\">功放与 LNA</a>及对应的数字预失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自适应波束成形与现代系统\">自适应波束成形与现代系统</h2><p>固定波束只是起点。自适应波束成形让阵列实时调整权值（幅相），把主瓣对准期望信号、把零点对准干扰源（零陷形成），这在抗干扰雷达、卫星通信、密集蜂窝网中价值巨大。算法层面，从经典的 LMS、MVDR（最小方差无失真响应）到近年与机器学习结合的智能波束管理，目标都是在动态环境中最大化信干噪比。在 6G 研究中，波束成形进一步与可重构智能表面（RIS）结合——用一面布满可调单元的「智能墙」被动地重塑环境中的电磁波路径，绕过遮挡。2026 年的现实是：毫米波通信几乎离不开波束成形，因为没有阵列增益就无法克服路径损耗；而波束的快速对准与跟踪（beam management）成了毫米波系统能否稳定工作的关键工程难题，这把本节直接引向<a href=\"../systems/modern-wireless\">现代无线系统与毫米波</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>阵列方向图 = 单元方向图 × 阵列因子；阵列因子只取决于排布与激励，使设计模块化。</li>\n<li>电调相位差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta=-kd\\sin\\theta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 即可无机械偏转波束，是相控阵的核心魔力。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 元阵增益约增 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\log_{10}N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> dB、波束变窄，恰补偿毫米波<a href=\"../systems/link-budget-noise\">链路预算</a>的路径损耗。</li>\n<li>栅瓣约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\le\\lambda/(1+|\\sin\\theta_{\\max}|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定单元数；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=\\lambda/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 是安全值，副瓣靠幅度锥削压低。</li>\n<li>模拟/数字/混合三架构折中成本与灵活；Massive MIMO 用数字波束成形，毫米波<a href=\"../systems/modern-wireless\">基站</a>用混合架构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"天线阵列与波束成形","id":"天线阵列与波束成形"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阵列因子、波束变窄与增益叠加","id":"阵列因子-波束变窄与增益叠加"},{"level":2,"text":"栅瓣与单元间距的硬约束","id":"栅瓣与单元间距的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"三种波束成形架构","id":"三种波束成形架构"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应波束成形与现代系统","id":"自适应波束成形与现代系统"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"常见天线类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/antennas/antenna-types"},"next":{"title":"链路预算与噪声","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/systems/link-budget-noise"}}